# Crash and Burn, second mode: "creature or planeswalker" (CR 115.1, 120.3c): damage to a planeswalker removes that many loyalty counters.
# On turn 3 Bot1 aims it at Bot2's Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3): 6 is more than enough, she is put into the graveyard (a state-based
# action, CR 704.5i). On turn 5 Bot1 aims the second at its own Ornithopter (0/2), which dies too.
# Bot2's Black Lotus went to its graveyard paying for Liliana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Crash and Burn
Crash and Burn
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Liliana of the Veil
Island x18

